# Proposal integrity (every RFP)

Principle-based — never client-specific keyword exceptions.

## Outline
- Intelligence outlines hard-cap RFP tabs (page-budget, typically 8–18). No one-tab-per-bullet.
- Eval-weight stamps need containment or ≥2 shared tokens — not one shared word.
- Offeror / Company Identification *forms* may stay (buyer needs the form) but must
  cross-ref Section 1.3 — never a second full Business Information dump.

## Facts & consistency
- After each section draft: full KB fact-check + consistency + companyfacts contradiction pass.
- Same agency fact (team size, certs, email, insurance types) must match everywhere; companyfacts wins.

## Insurance certifications (signed forms)
- Exception / compliance forms must NOT mark coverages Compliant or claim "meets or exceeds" unless Section 1.5 (or companyfacts) lists that coverage type and limit.
- Otherwise → `[MANUAL FILL: Sonja — confirm on COI]` or a real exception / bind-before-execution. Same severity as fabricated vendor registration.
- Gate runs on **generate**, **Complete Scan**, and **section chat persist** via `apply_zero_fabrication_guards_before_persist` — not only one path.

## Capabilities & case studies
- Never assert past technical deliveries the included case studies / bios / companyfacts do not evidence.
- Past-proven tables ("we have implemented…") → can-deliver language or VERIFY — Complete Scan,
  chat **remove fabricated content**, and content-risk repair all run this scrub.
- Case-study framing must match the studies shown; utility/gov RFPs must not keep private medical personal-brand studies.
- Specialist role titles must map to a named Section 2 bio or be MANUAL FILL / subcontractor / generalist.
- Bio years/specializations must match 04_Bio exactly — never inflate years or add sector specialization
  the bio PDF does not state (chat + Complete Scan ground bios to KB).
- Chat/Apply-fix must REPLACE invented bio sentences with 04_Bio wording — never delete the
  paragraph and leave a Role-only gap. Strip [E#] markers. Drop empty headers.

## Evidence matching
- Follow `no-regex-evidence-matching.mdc`: LLM + Supermemory + grounded quotes — no platform synonym frozensets.
